    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Subsection 285(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006#sch-1-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\npublic number directory means a record:\n\n(a) that contains either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the names of persons and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses);\n\n(ii) the names of bodies and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses); and\n\n(b) that, in relation to a person or body that is not a qualifying\nentity, contains no other information about the person or\nbody; and\n\n(c) that, in relation to a person or body that is a qualifying entity,\ncontains no other information about the person or body apart\nfrom information:\n\n(i) that is of a kind specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(ii) that is applicable in relation to the person or body; and\n\n(d) that:\n\n(i) does not enable a person who only knows the public\nnumber of an end-user of a carriage service to readily\nidentify the end-user’s name and/or address; and\n\n(ii) does not enable a person who only knows the whole or a\npart of the address of an end-user of a carriage service to\nreadily identify the end-user’s name and/or public\nnumber; and\n\n(e) that satisfies each requirement specified in an instrument\nunder subsection (5).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\npublic number directory means a record:\n\n(a) that contains either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the names of persons and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses);\n\n(ii) the names of bodies and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses); and\n\n(b) that, in relation to a person or body that is not a qualifying\nentity, contains no other information about the person or\nbody; and\n\n(c) that, in relation to a person or body that is a qualifying entity,\ncontains no other information about the person or body apart\nfrom information:\n\n(i) that is of a kind specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(ii) that is applicable in relation to the person or body; and\n\n(d) that:\n\n(i) does not enable a person who only knows the public\nnumber of an end-user of a carriage service to readily\nidentify the end-user’s name and/or address; and\n\n(ii) does not enable a person who only knows the whole or a\npart of the address of an end-user of a carriage service to\nreadily identify the end-user’s name and/or public\nnumber; and\n\n(e) that satisfies each requirement specified in an instrument\nunder subsection (5).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-6-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc1eb5a35f03ec284690257c0f4db319b26ab552d09a3c419c90889f93ece074",
      "skos:note": "Defines public number directory record requirements"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006#sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Subsection 285(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\npublic number directory means a record:\n\n(a) that contains either or both of the following:\n\n(i) the names of persons and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses);\n\n(ii) the names of bodies and their public numbers (whether\nor not it also contains their addresses); and\n\n(b) that, in relation to a person or body that is not a qualifying\nentity, contains no other information about the person or\nbody; and\n\n(c) that, in relation to a person or body that is a qualifying entity,\ncontains no other information about the person or body apart\nfrom information:\n\n(i) that is of a kind specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(ii) that is applicable in relation to the person or body; and\n\n(d) that:\n\n(i) does not enable a person who only knows the public\nnumber of an end-user of a carriage service to readily\nidentify the end-user’s name and/or address; and\n\n(ii) does not enable a person who only knows the whole or a\npart of the address of an end-user of a carriage service to\nreadily identify the end-user’s name and/or public\nnumber; and\n\n(e) that satisfies each requirement specified in an instrument\nunder subsection (5)."
    },
