      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Schedule 1  Amendments\n\n6            Telecommunications Amendment (Integrated Public Number Database) Act 2006       No.\n155, 2006\nInsert:\nqualifying entity means:\n\n(a) a person or body carrying on a business; or\n\n(b) a charity or charitable institution; or\n\n(c) an educational institution; or\n\n(d) a religious organisation; or\n\n(e) a department of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(f) an agency, authority or instrumentality of the\nCommonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(g) any other person or body of a kind specified in an instrument\nunder subsection (6).",
      "skos:definition": "Schedule 1  Amendments\n\n6            Telecommunications Amendment (Integrated Public Number Database) Act 2006       No.\n155, 2006\nInsert:\nqualifying entity means:\n\n(a) a person or body carrying on a business; or\n\n(b) a charity or charitable institution; or\n\n(c) an educational institution; or\n\n(d) a religious organisation; or\n\n(e) a department of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(f) an agency, authority or instrumentality of the\nCommonwealth, a State or a Territory; or\n\n(g) any other person or body of a kind specified in an instrument\nunder subsection (6).",
      "cml:asserts": [
