      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "295B Scheme must deal with certain matters",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006#sch-1-sec-295b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The scheme must make provision for and in relation to the\nfollowing matters:\n\n(a) the making of applications for authorisations;\n\n(b) the assessment of applications;\n\n(c) the period for which authorisations are to be in force;\n\n(d) the notification of decisions under the scheme (including to\nthe person who maintains the integrated public number\ndatabase referred to in paragraph 285(1A)(a)).\n\n(2) The scheme must require an applicant for an authorisation to\nspecify the purpose for which the authorisation is sought.\nNote:\nThe relevant purposes are purposes connected with the publication and\nmaintenance of a public number directory or with the conduct of\nparticular research.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\n8            Telecommunications Amendment (Integrated Public Number Database) Act 2006       No.\n155, 2006",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The scheme must make provision for and in relation to the\nfollowing matters:\n\n(a) the making of applications for authorisations;\n\n(b) the assessment of applications;\n\n(c) the period for which authorisations are to be in force;\n\n(d) the notification of decisions under the scheme (including to\nthe person who maintains the integrated public number\ndatabase referred to in paragraph 285(1A)(a)).\n\n(2) The scheme must require an applicant for an authorisation to\nspecify the purpose for which the authorisation is sought.\nNote:\nThe relevant purposes are purposes connected with the publication and\nmaintenance of a public number directory or with the conduct of\nparticular research.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\n8            Telecommunications Amendment (Integrated Public Number Database) Act 2006       No.\n155, 2006",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f798ec97e70ba9ce18662f16671abb6e68b846d074d8289df8acec1d43c96dc2"
    },
