      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "The scheme may make provision for authorisations to be in respect\nof:\n\n(a) all information or documents that satisfy the matters referred\nto in paragraphs 285(1A)(a) and (b); or\n\n(b) specified information or specified documents that satisfy\nthose matters.",
      "skos:definition": "The scheme may make provision for authorisations to be in respect\nof:\n\n(a) all information or documents that satisfy the matters referred\nto in paragraphs 285(1A)(a) and (b); or\n\n(b) specified information or specified documents that satisfy\nthose matters.",
