    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "295N Criteria for deciding authorisation applications",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006#sch-1-sec-295n"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify criteria for\ndeciding authorisation applications made under the integrated\npublic number database scheme.\n\n(2) The Minister may specify different criteria for different kinds of\nauthorisation applications.\n\n(3) In deciding an authorisation application, the ACMA:\n\n(a) must apply the criteria applicable to that application; and\n\n(b) may have regard to any other matters that it thinks are\nrelevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify criteria for\ndeciding authorisation applications made under the integrated\npublic number database scheme.\n\n(2) The Minister may specify different criteria for different kinds of\nauthorisation applications.\n\n(3) In deciding an authorisation application, the ACMA:\n\n(a) must apply the criteria applicable to that application; and\n\n(b) may have regard to any other matters that it thinks are\nrelevant.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd3fe94ca4337bb1fbb4c0d0192f7b8f1031be79191519f47355bf08ddd2278a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006#sch-1-sec-295n",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "295N Criteria for deciding authorisation applications",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify criteria for\ndeciding authorisation applications made under the integrated\npublic number database scheme.\n\n(2) The Minister may specify different criteria for different kinds of\nauthorisation applications.\n\n(3) In deciding an authorisation application, the ACMA:\n\n(a) must apply the criteria applicable to that application; and\n\n(b) may have regard to any other matters that it thinks are\nrelevant."
    },
